cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or the article, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "What AI coding agents could not open: 19,611 page fetches by six agents on one PC"
abstract: >-
  Every web page fetch that Claude Code, Claude Desktop, Codex, OpenCode, MiMo Code and Antigravity made on one
  Windows PC from 2026-05-09 to 2026-11-16, one row per call and URL, with the tool used and the outcome: content,
  refusal by the site, challenge page, HTTP 402, not found, redirect, network error or tool-side error. With the two
  scanners that read the agents' local histories.
authors:
